es":{"id":"20260726153112-7vvud08","updated":"20260726153112"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260726153112-2r1wr1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260726153112-2r1wr1t","updated":"20260726153112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"路径补充："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"_buildResult()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可能在末尾追加“相关模块路径”"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260726153112-aiigabc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260726153112-aiigabc","updated":"20260726153112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 规则引擎固定话术"}]},{"ID":"20260726153112-314jssg","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 结果分类 | 触发条件 | 话术要点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hardware_issue` | `failureBucketId` 命中硬件桶；或 `0xc0000006 / 0xc000009c / 0xc000009d` 且不被其他场景接走 | 硬件/存储故障，建议查磁盘、内存 |\n| `hardware_issue_with_ime` | 上面两类硬件判定成立，同时检测到第三方输入法 | 硬件故障 + 输入法作为伴随因素，建议再排查输入法 |\n| `environment_issue` | `0x80000003` + `CEF/Chromium` 内核命中资源/环境相关函数 | CEF 资源文件损坏/缺失或环境异常，建议覆盖安装 |\n| `self_exit` | `0x40000015 / 0xfff00f01`；或 `CRT` 触发的 `terminate / abort / _purecall / _invalid_parameter / bad_alloc` | 进程主动退出、企微自身 Bug，或内存分配失败 |\n| `third_party_not_hit` | 栈顶是企微自身模块，但没命中第三方 | 企微自身问题，建议升级或反馈研发 |\n| `unable_to_analyze` | 缺异常码、规则都没命中、或调用链太乱 | 无法自动判定，建议人工复核 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260726153112-314jssg","updated":"20260726153112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果分类"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发条件"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"话术要点"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hardware_issue"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"failureBucketId"},{